---
title: Matcha Smoothie
servings: 1
time required: 5 minutes
course: Drink
cuisine: American
image: https://thewoodenskillet.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/matcha-smoothie-recipe-5.jpg
---

In a #blender, blend together @matcha powder{2%tbsp}(generally to taste by strength of matcha), @bananas{2}(frozen), @milk{1%cup}, @vanilla extract{splash}, @ice{1%handful}, @honey{1%tbsp}, and @?vanilla protein powder{1%scoop} until smooth.

> You can alternatively replace the ice with 1 cup vanilla yogurt, if you have it on hand.